1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
At four-oh-seven on a Monday afternoon,
everything began to change.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Richard Vale announced his retirement.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Before the board named a successor,
everyone was already choosing sides.

4
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:38,000
In a company built on appearances,
silence can be a strategy.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Who gets the throne
when the person holding it steps away?

6
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:55,000
THE GLASS THRONE.
A novel by John Zhang.

7
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
